{"3810120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Turning The Tide", "steam_appid": 3810120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to January 1941. The Allied forces have just repelled an attempted Nazi invasion in the Battle of Britain and their forces are severely stretched and at breaking point. Despite this setback for the Nazis, their march towards total world domination is gathering pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/4c42d3549037844cb3640efa974751f5.poster.avif?t=1762166303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/4c42d3549037844cb3640efa974751f5.webm?t=1762166303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/4c42d3549037844cb3640efa974751f5.mp4?t=1762166303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New plans are being hatched to halt the seemingly impossible Nazi war machine and turn the tide towards an all out victory for the Allied forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU have been hand-picked to carry out solo missions of vital importance to High Command. Carry these out successfully and you will turn the tide towards an all out Allied victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/fbe02c4d21a5fcb977bd854ba0574ea1.apng?t=1762166303\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/fbe02c4d21a5fcb977bd854ba0574ea1.poster.avif?t=1762166303\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>               <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/9f0bdde731b5c370d7ecceb732eea462.apng?t=1762166303\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/9f0bdde731b5c370d7ecceb732eea462.poster.avif?t=1762166303\" class=\"bb_img\" width=62 height=52 /></picture></span>              <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/48592b34a33e70ef9285e549c6b1d0d0.webp?t=1762166303\" width=75 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLY, SHOOT, SWOOP, BOMB, DEPTH CHARGE &amp; STRAFE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global rankings as you go from flying covert ops to taking part in a dogfight over London to destroying enemy radar stations and weapons factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send enemy soldiers flying with strategically placed bombs or sending them diving for cover whilst strafing their encampments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/755f040fe83f39368eb0785c7c1e5a7e.poster.avif?t=1762166303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/755f040fe83f39368eb0785c7c1e5a7e.webm?t=1762166303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/755f040fe83f39368eb0785c7c1e5a7e.mp4?t=1762166303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and destroy submarines, planes, tanks, blimps, boats, landing ships and more through 13 levels of action-packed fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DO THE RIGHT THING BECOME A HERO!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/125e87fe9df3095ead719ad0d8313f0f.avif?t=1762166303\" width=718 height=297 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to January 1941. The Allied forces have just repelled an attempted Nazi invasion in the Battle of Britain and their forces are severely stretched and at breaking point. Despite this setback for the Nazis, their march towards total world domination is gathering pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/4c42d3549037844cb3640efa974751f5.poster.avif?t=1762166303\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/4c42d3549037844cb3640efa974751f5.webm?t=1762166303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/4c42d3549037844cb3640efa974751f5.mp4?t=1762166303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New plans are being hatched to halt the seemingly impossible Nazi war machine and turn the tide towards an all out victory for the Allied forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU have been hand-picked to carry out solo missions of vital importance to High Command. Carry these out successfully and you will turn the tide towards an all out Allied victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/fbe02c4d21a5fcb977bd854ba0574ea1.apng?t=1762166303\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/fbe02c4d21a5fcb977bd854ba0574ea1.poster.avif?t=1762166303\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=32 /></picture></span>               <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/9f0bdde731b5c370d7ecceb732eea462.apng?t=1762166303\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/9f0bdde731b5c370d7ecceb732eea462.poster.avif?t=1762166303\" class=\"bb_img\" width=62 height=52 /></picture></span>              <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/48592b34a33e70ef9285e549c6b1d0d0.webp?t=1762166303\" width=75 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLY, SHOOT, SWOOP, BOMB, DEPTH CHARGE &amp; STRAFE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the global rankings as you go from flying covert ops to taking part in a dogfight over London to destroying enemy radar stations and weapons factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send enemy soldiers flying with strategically placed bombs or sending them diving for cover whilst strafing their encampments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810120/extras/755f